flowchart TD

    A[Client Sends Request]

    --> B[Access Token]

    --> C[permissionChecker]

    --> D[checkExpiration]

    --> E[verifyToken]

    --> F[JWT Verify Signature]

    --> G{Signature Valid?}

    G -->|No| X[Authentication Error]

    G -->|Yes| H[Decode JWT Payload]

    --> I[Check Token Expiration]

    I -->|Expired| X

    I -->|Valid| J[nearExpiry]

    --> K[Decoded Payload]

    --> L[Extract providedPermissions]

    --> M{Required Permission Found?}

    M -->|Yes| N[Grant Access]

    M -->|No| O[Database Permission Validation]

    O --> P{Permission Found?}

    P -->|Yes| N

    P -->|No| Q[403 Forbidden]

    N --> R[Generate permission_results]

    --> S[Continue Middleware Pipeline]